@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC02 — Attach a selected material: conversation
top to bottom direction
state "1. Select source occurrence\nTeacher" as S1
state "2. Decode and check token\nrepository_coursebridge" as S2
state "3. Validate access / copy policy\nmaterial_source / author_policy" as S3
state "4. Copy native draft\nrepository_coursebridge" as S4
state "5. Save native editing form\nTeacher / Moodle" as S5
state "Refused / blocked outcome" as Refused
[*] --> S1
S1 --> S2
S2 --> S3
S3 --> S4
S4 --> S5
S5 --> [*]
S3 -right-> Refused
note bottom of Refused
See the use-case alternatives.
No unsupported write is permitted.
end note
@enduml
